 -->: </span>Info</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">12:35:09</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\">identity-broker-prod-02</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_cellTruncate__Wg_q3\" title=\"Break-glass account checked out and returned (28 min)\">Break-glass account checked out and returned (28 min)</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"u-mono\" title=\"Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts\">T1078.004</span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\"> — <!-- -->Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\">J. Castellanos</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_state__cr6xI\"><span class=\"product_stateDot__YKybR product_stateDotOpen__UcqmX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Monitoring</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"product_panel__OdQEL\"><div class=\"product_panelHead__4kvE9\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevCritical__qnAYH\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Critical</span><span class=\"product_panelTitle__JPdIG\"><span class=\"u-mono\">ENX-88214</span> — <!-- -->Impossible travel followed by privileged API enumeration</span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><span class=\"u-mono\">ENX-DET-0412 v7</span> ·<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono\">T1078.004</span> <span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Valid Accounts: Cloud Accounts</span></span></div><div class=\"product_panelBody__TbKeY\"><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\">Session for d.okafor authenticated from AS9009 (Bucharest) 91 seconds after a successful MFA sign-in from the London office range, then enumerated 1,106 booking records through /v2/consignments before the token was revoked.</p><div><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">Evidence</p><dl class=\"product_kv__qZr9Y\"><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Principal</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">d.okafor@northwind-logistics.example</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Source address</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">45.147.231.86</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Source ASN</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">AS9009 — M247 Europe SRL</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Prior sign-in</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">10.42.26.144 · 14:20:36 UTC</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Session token</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">eyJhbGci…a3f1c9e4b2</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Records touched</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono\">1,106 of 48,312</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Detection latency</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS \">91 s from first anomalous call</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"product_step2__X16s2\"><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">Triage notes</p><ol class=\"product_notes__lyeOr\"><li class=\"product_note__lrnYE\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"product_noteMeta__tbFlh\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:22:41<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">K. Osei</span></span><p class=\"product_noteBody__esLIG\">Confirmed the 14:20:36 sign-in is genuine — device NWL-LT-4417, compliant, MFA satisfied. The 14:22:07 session reuses the same refresh token from a hosting ASN. Token theft, not a shared account.</p></li><li class=\"product_note__lrnYE\" style=\"--enter-delay:60ms\"><span class=\"product_noteMeta__tbFlh\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:24:09<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">M. Thorne</span></span><p class=\"product_noteBody__esLIG\">Pulled the browser credential store timeline on NWL-LT-4417. ENX-88209 fired on the same host at 14:03:58 for T1555.003. That is the acquisition step. Treating as one chain, not two alerts.</p></li><li class=\"product_note__lrnYE\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"product_noteMeta__tbFlh\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:26:55<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">M. Thorne</span></span><p class=\"product_noteBody__esLIG\">Revoked all refresh tokens for the principal, forced re-enrolment, isolated NWL-LT-4417. Client security lead (R. Venkatesan) acknowledged on the bridge at 14:26:12.</p></li></ol></div><div class=\"product_step3___C_Q0\"><div class=\"product_verdict__bReey\"><span class=\"product_verdictHead__uYXXj\"><span class=\"product_verdictLabel__rB0nq\">Analyst conclusion</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14:29:33<!-- --> UTC</span><span class=\"product_noteAnalyst__ixJaY\">M. Thorne</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Incident <span class=\"u-mono\">INC-2026-0417</span></span></span><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\"><strong class=\"product_strong__md3es\">True positive — confirmed credential theft and replay. No data exfiltration observed.</strong></p><p class=\"product_panelProse__xSnHp\">Tokens revoked, host isolated, egress to AS9009 blocked at the edge. 1,106 accessed records enumerated for the client’s notification assessment; booking payloads are not special-category data.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"product_statusbar__oc8me\"><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\"><span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">9</span> open</span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Log sources<!-- --> <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R u-mono u-tnum\">312<!-- -->/<!-- -->317</span> <!-- -->healthy</span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">4.18 bn</span> events/day</span><span class=\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Incident <span class=\"u-mono\">INC-2026-0417</span> · commander<!-- --> <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">M. Thorne</span></span></div></div><figcaption class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Representative view of the managed SIEM console at the point an analyst has recorded a conclusion and containment. Illustrative data — not a client estate.</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class=\"dg-console\"><div class=\"dg-consoleSay\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Why the queue stays readable</p><h3 class=\"dg-consoleTitle\">Most of the signal never reaches a human</h3><p class=\"dg-consoleBody\">Correlation and suppression content closes the bulk of a day’s alerts before analyst review. The share that is read by a person is the number that decides whether a service level means anything.</p></div><div class=\"dg-consoleArt\"><figure data-reveal=\"\" class=\"product_figure__CFsTQ\"><div class=\"product_console__JtIC_\"><div class=\"product_titlebar__rns9g\"><span class=\"product_titleGroup__MMGDe\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-pie product_titleIcon__O6a8i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 12c.552 0 1.005-.449.95-.998a10 10 0 0 0-8.953-8.951c-.55-.055-.998.398-.998.95v8a1 1 0 0 0 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M21.21 15.89A10 10 0 1 1 8 2.83\"></path></svg><span class=\"product_title__jwaL7\">Managed SIEM — Signal breakdown</span><span class=\"product_tenant__pmMjS\">Northwind Logistics Group<!-- --> · <span class=\"u-mono\">TEN-4471</span></span></span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">24 h to 2026-10-14 14:31 UTC</span></span></div><div class=\"product_gaugeLayout__ktUnS\"><div class=\"product_gaugeCell__Xxf4C\"><div class=\"product_gaugeStack__tPwmq\"><svg class=\"product_gauge__z1uRo\" viewBox=\"0 0 128 128\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"81.81% of signal — 2,329 of 2,847 alerts — was closed by correlation and suppression content before analyst review, over the 24 h to 2026-10-14 14:31 UTC. The remaining 518 alerts were read by a human analyst.\"><g transform=\"rotate(-90 64 64)\"><circle class=\"product_gaugeTrack__JqQjp\" cx=\"64\" cy=\"64\" r=\"54\"></circle><path class=\"product_gaugeArc__uR9Ql\" d=\"M118 64 A54 54 0 1 1 86.393 14.862\" style=\"--dash:277.559;stroke-dasharray:277.559 277.559\"></path></g></svg><div class=\"product_gaugeReadout__NGeC0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"product_gaugeValue__h8ndW u-mono u-tnum\">81.81<!-- -->%</span><span class=\"product_gaugeUnit__9XaA0\">closed by content</span></div></div><dl class=\"product_gaugeFacts__31L_R\"><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_gaugeFactKey__u_Yuk\">Closed before review</dt><dd class=\"product_gaugeFactVal___yIlQ u-mono u-tnum\">2,329</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_gaugeFactKey__u_Yuk\">Read by an analyst</dt><dd class=\"product_gaugeFactVal___yIlQ u-mono u-tnum\">518</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_gaugeFactKey__u_Yuk\">Total signal</dt><dd class=\"product_gaugeFactVal___yIlQ u-mono u-tnum\">2,847</dd></div></dl></div><div class=\"product_breakdownCell__8Ggr_\"><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">By severity — <!-- -->24 h to 2026-10-14 14:31 UTC</p><div class=\"product_breakdown__cbxRc\" role=\"table\" aria-label=\"Alert count by severity\"><div class=\"product_head__PTccq\" role=\"row\"><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\">Severity</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J product_headCellRight__348kj\" role=\"columnheader\">Alerts</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J product_headCellRight__348kj\" role=\"columnheader\">Share</span><span class=\"product_headCell__m8m1J\" role=\"columnheader\"><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Proportion, drawn</span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y product_sevCritical__qnAYH\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevCritical__qnAYH\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Critical</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">3</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">0.11<!-- -->%</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_barTrack__ZnBNw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"product_barFill__NSFfP\" style=\"width:0.6%\"></span></span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y product_sevHigh__aqAna\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:60ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevHigh__aqAna\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>High</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">17</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">0.60<!-- -->%</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_barTrack__ZnBNw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"product_barFill__NSFfP\" style=\"width:0.6%\"></span></span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y product_sevMedium__b33PA\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevMedium__b33PA\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Medium</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">86</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">3.02<!-- -->%</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_barTrack__ZnBNw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"product_barFill__NSFfP\" style=\"width:3.02%\"></span></span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y product_sevLow__yBYsg\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:180ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevLow__yBYsg\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Low</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">412</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">14.47<!-- -->%</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_barTrack__ZnBNw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"product_barFill__NSFfP\" style=\"width:14.47%\"></span></span></span></div><div class=\"product_row__geDuE product_rowHover__qWq3Y product_sevInfo__5_4F5\" role=\"row\" style=\"--enter-delay:240ms\"><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_railCell__vgygh\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevInfo__5_4F5\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Severity<!-- -->: </span>Info</span></span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">2,329</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO product_cellRight__X07rW u-mono u-tnum\" role=\"cell\">81.81<!-- -->%</span><span class=\"product_cell__AfUwO\" role=\"cell\"><span class=\"product_barTrack__ZnBNw\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"product_barFill__NSFfP\" style=\"width:81.81%\"></span></span></span></div></div><p class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Shares are rounded to two decimal places and therefore sum to<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">100.01%</span>, not<!-- --> <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">100.00%</span>. Counts are exact:<!-- --> <!-- -->3 Critical, 17 High, 86 Medium, 412 Low, 2329 Info<!-- -->.</p></div></div><div class=\"product_statusbar__oc8me\"><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Correlation rules <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">1,412</span> active</span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Suppressions <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">287</span> · reviewed monthly</span><span class=\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Content release <span class=\"u-mono\">2026.10.2</span></span></div></div><figcaption class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Representative view of a 24-hour signal breakdown and the severity distribution behind it. Illustrative data — not a client estate.</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class=\"dg-console\"><div class=\"dg-consoleSay\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">The service level, measured</p><h3 class=\"dg-consoleTitle\">Time to human contact, not time to forwarding</h3><p class=\"dg-consoleBody\">A service level measured on how fast an alert was forwarded rewards forwarding. This is the monthly report shape we commit to instead: contact, containment and the misses, with the misses still on the page.</p></div><div class=\"dg-consoleArt\"><figure data-reveal=\"\" class=\"product_figure__CFsTQ\"><div class=\"product_console__JtIC_\"><div class=\"product_titlebar__rns9g\"><span class=\"product_titleGroup__MMGDe\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check product_titleIcon__O6a8i\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"product_title__jwaL7\">Service level — Monthly report</span><span class=\"product_tenant__pmMjS\">Northwind Logistics Group<!-- --> · <span class=\"u-mono\">TEN-4471</span></span></span><span class=\"product_titleSpacer__ZMvYH\"></span><span class=\"product_titleMeta__atJAM\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">1–31 October 2026</span></span></div><div class=\"product_slaHeadline__W8VHf\"><div class=\"product_slaFigure__TrcDh\"><span class=\"product_slaValue__10xgz u-mono u-tnum\">99.982%</span><span class=\"product_slaLabel__0I6Dq\">Edge availability</span><span class=\"product_slaBasis__mtVcb\">Edge availability, 1–31 October 2026 (744 h), measured from 6 external probes at 30 s intervals</span></div><dl class=\"product_slaAgainst__qQY_g\"><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Contractual target</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono u-tnum\">99.950%</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Availability lost</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS u-mono u-tnum\">8 m 03 s<!-- --> of <!-- -->44,640<!-- --> min</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\"><dt class=\"product_kvKey__jhWo7\">Measurement</dt><dd class=\"product_kvVal__LeVCS\">6 external probes, 30 s interval, 2-of-6 failure quorum</dd></div><div class=\"product_kvRow__4UVrC\">