\"product_dayNum__EnRxS u-mono u-tnum\" aria-hidden=\"true\">31</span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">31<!-- --> October 2026: <!-- -->Full availability</span></li></ol><div><p class=\"product_sectionLabel__iRUDV\">Exceptions in the window</p><ul class=\"product_exceptionList__q0mwX\"><li class=\"product_exception__AEWIs\" style=\"--enter-delay:0ms\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevInfo__5_4F5\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Day state<!-- -->: </span>Planned maintenance</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">6<!-- --> Oct 2026</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Scheduled, announced 10 d ahead — no requests lost</span></li><li class=\"product_exception__AEWIs\" style=\"--enter-delay:60ms\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevMedium__b33PA\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Day state<!-- -->: </span>Degraded</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">14<!-- --> Oct 2026</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">5 m 12 s — edge-waf-ams-01 BGP reconvergence</span></li><li class=\"product_exception__AEWIs\" style=\"--enter-delay:120ms\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevInfo__5_4F5\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Day state<!-- -->: </span>Planned maintenance</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">20<!-- --> Oct 2026</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">Scheduled, announced 10 d ahead — no requests lost</span></li><li class=\"product_exception__AEWIs\" style=\"--enter-delay:180ms\"><span class=\"product_sevBadge__tIWHP product_sevMedium__b33PA\"><span class=\"product_sevMark__N39VN\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"product_srOnly__1a3B7\">Day state<!-- -->: </span>Degraded</span><span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">22<!-- --> Oct 2026</span><span class=\"product_muted__1Uj0m\">2 m 51 s — TLS terminator rolling restart</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class=\"product_statusbar__oc8me\"><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Report generated <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-11-01 09:00 UTC</span></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Signed off <span class=\"product_statusStrong__YKQ3R\">M. Thorne</span>, service delivery</span><span class=\"product_statusSpacer__zs5xg\"></span><span class=\"product_statusItem__tAFbC\">Next review <span class=\"u-mono u-tnum\">2026-11-12</span></span></div></div><figcaption class=\"product_caption__f0O7Y\">Representative view of the monthly service-level report. Illustrative data — not a client estate.</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"included\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Scope</p><h2 id=\"included\" class=\"sv-h2\">What is included</h2></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--3\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Detection engineering</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Detections written against your architecture and mapped to MITRE ATT&amp;CK, version-controlled and reviewed like code. Detection-as-code, in a repository you can read.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">24/7 triage and investigation</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Human analysts, not a forwarding service. Investigation happens before escalation, and the escalation carries a conclusion.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Containment</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Pre-authorised actions executed inside your runbook — host isolation, session revocation, key disablement — with immediate notification.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Threat hunting</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Hypothesis-driven hunts each month against your telemetry, informed by what we see across the client base and in our own research.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Platform operations</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">We operate your SIEM and EDR — Wazuh, Elastic, Microsoft Sentinel, CrowdStrike, SentinelOne — or run ours. Your data stays in your tenancy and your region.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><h3 class=\"sv-h3\">Coverage reporting</h3><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Monthly ATT&amp;CK coverage, detection changes, alert volume, false-positive rate and tuning decisions, with the reasoning.</p></div></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"methodology\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">The Adversary Loop</p><h2 id=\"methodology\" class=\"sv-h2\">How the engagement runs</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">Threat models shape the build. The build gets attacked. The attack rewrites the threat model.</p></div><figure class=\"dg\" id=\"engagement-shape\"><svg class=\"dg-gantt\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 252\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Engagement shape for Managed Detection &amp; Response: 6 phases. Phase 1, Architecture onboarding, Weeks 1–2, inside the engagement window. Phase 2, Telemetry and baseline, Weeks 2–4, inside the engagement window. Phase 3, Detection build, Weeks 4–6, inside the engagement window, producing the detection repository, version-controlled, mapped to mitre att&amp;ck, yours to keep. Phase 4, Runbook and authority, Week 6, inside the engagement window, producing the incident runbook with agreed containment authority and escalation paths. Phase 5, Go live, Week 7, inside the engagement window. Phase 6, Operate and improve, Ongoing, no fixed window.\"><text class=\"dg-axisUnit\" x=\"0\" y=\"16\">weeks from kick-off</text><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"236\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"236\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text></g><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"379.42857142857144\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"379.42857142857144\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"379.42857142857144\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text></g><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"522.8571428571429\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"522.8571428571429\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"522.8571428571429\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text></g><g><line class=\"dg-grid\" x1=\"666.2857142857142\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"666.2857142857142\" y2=\"226\"></line><text class=\"dg-tick\" x=\"666.2857142857142\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text></g><line class=\"dg-zero\" x1=\"236\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"236\" y2=\"232\"></line><text class=\"dg-zeroLabel\" x=\"236\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\">kick-off</text><text class=\"dg-colHead\" x=\"762\" y=\"16\">Drops out</text><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"65\">01</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"65\">Architecture onboarding</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"236\" y=\"53.5\" width=\"143.42857142857144\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"387.42857142857144\" y=\"64\">Weeks 1–2</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"64\">—</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\">02</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"95\">Telemetry and baseline</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"307.7142857142857\" y=\"83.5\" width=\"215.14285714285717\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"530.8571428571429\" y=\"94\">Weeks 2–4</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"94\">—</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"125\">03</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"125\">Detection build</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"451.1428571428571\" y=\"113.5\" width=\"215.1428571428571\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"674.2857142857142\" y=\"124\">Weeks 4–6</text><line class=\"dg-leader\" x1=\"748\" y1=\"121\" x2=\"757\" y2=\"121\"></line><rect class=\"dg-artMark\" x=\"757\" y=\"117\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect><text class=\"dg-art\" x=\"771\" y=\"124\">Detection repository, version…</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"155\">04</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"155\">Runbook and authority</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"594.5714285714286\" y=\"143.5\" width=\"71.71428571428567\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"674.2857142857142\" y=\"154\">Week 6</text><line class=\"dg-leader\" x1=\"748\" y1=\"151\" x2=\"757\" y2=\"151\"></line><rect class=\"dg-artMark\" x=\"757\" y=\"147\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect><text class=\"dg-art\" x=\"771\" y=\"154\">Incident runbook with agreed…</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"185\">05</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"185\">Go live</text><rect class=\"dg-bar dg-bar--window\" x=\"666.2857142857142\" y=\"173.5\" width=\"71.71428571428578\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"></rect><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"658.2857142857142\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"end\">Week 7</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"184\">—</text></g><g><text class=\"dg-rowNum\" x=\"0\" y=\"215\">06</text><text class=\"dg-rowName\" x=\"34\" y=\"215\">Operate and improve</text><line class=\"dg-standing\" x1=\"236\" y1=\"211\" x2=\"738\" y2=\"211\"></line><text class=\"dg-barLabel\" x=\"242\" y=\"205\">Ongoing</text><text class=\"dg-artNone\" x=\"771\" y=\"214\">—</text></g></svg><div class=\"dg-ganttText\"><ol class=\"dg-sched\"><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">01</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Architecture onboarding</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Weeks 1–2</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">02</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Telemetry and baseline</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Weeks 2–4</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">03</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Detection build</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Weeks 4–6</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Detection repository, version-controlled, mapped to MITRE ATT&amp;CK, yours to keep</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">04</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Runbook and authority</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Week 6</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Incident runbook with agreed containment authority and escalation paths</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"window\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">05</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Go live</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Week 7</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Inside the engagement window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li><li class=\"dg-schedRow\" data-stage=\"standing\"><p class=\"dg-schedHead\"><span class=\"u-mono dg-schedNum\">06</span><span class=\"dg-schedName\">Operate and improve</span></p><p class=\"dg-schedWhen u-mono\">Ongoing</p><p class=\"dg-schedStage\">Runs throughout — no fixed window</p><p class=\"dg-schedArt\"><span class=\"dg-schedArtKey\">Drops out</span>Nothing the service lists separately</p></li></ol></div><figcaption class=\"dg-cap\"><ul class=\"dg-legend\"><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"before\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Before the window opens</li><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"window\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Inside the engagement window</li><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"after\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>After the report — a commitment, not an upsell</li><li class=\"dg-legendItem\" data-stage=\"standing\"><span class=\"dg-legendMark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Standing work with no fixed window</li></ul><p class=\"dg-capNote\">Every bar is positioned and sized from that phase’s own stated schedule, converted to a single week axis and drawn to one scale. <!-- -->Nothing is rounded to make the picture tidier, and a phase whose schedule the service does not state — standing work, a quarterly cadence, anything open-ended — is drawn as a dotted row carrying its own words rather than handed a plausible-looking bar it never had.</p></figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-phaseStack\"><div class=\"stack\"><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">01 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Architecture onboarding</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Weeks 1–2</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Your architecture, identity model, crown jewels and existing telemetry. We write down what an attack on you would look like before writing a single detection.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">02 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Telemetry and baseline</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Weeks 2–4</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Log sources connected and validated — a source that is configured but not arriving is the most common gap we find. Normal behaviour baselined.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">03 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Detection build</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Weeks 4–6</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Detections written, tested against replayed technique data, and committed to the detection repository.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">04 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Runbook and authority</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Week 6</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Agree what we may do without asking, what needs a call, and who to call at 3am. A containment authority nobody agreed to is a containment authority nobody uses.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">05 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Go live</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Week 7</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Parallel run, then full handover of monitoring. A purple-team exercise in week eight validates the coverage with real technique execution.</p></div></article><article class=\"stack__card\"><span class=\"stack__index\">06 / 06</span><h3 class=\"stack__title\">Operate and improve</h3><div class=\"stack__body\"><p class=\"sv-phaseWhen u-mono\">Ongoing</p><p class=\"sv-phaseBody\">Monthly hunts, quarterly purple team, continuous tuning. Coverage is reported as a trend, not as a number in isolation.</p></div></article></div></div><p class=\"sv-note\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" href=\"/methodologies\"><span>Read the methodology — How we run an engagement</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"deliverables\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s6)\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Deliverables</p><h2 id=\"deliverables\" class=\"sv-h2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">Exactly what lands in your inbox</h2><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Walk a redacted sample before you buy one</a></p><div class=\"sv-deliverableArt\"><figure class=\"dg dg-stackFig\"><svg class=\"dg-stack\" viewBox=\"0 0 531 358\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin meet\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"What lands in your inbox on a Managed Detection &amp; Response engagement: 6 deliverables. 1, Detection repository, version-controlled, mapped to MITRE ATT&amp;CK, yours to keep, in your repo. 2, Validated log source inventory with coverage gaps named, written document. 3, Incident runbook with agreed containment authority and escalation paths, operating doc. 4, Monthly coverage and tuning report with reasoning, not just counts, written report. 5, Quarterly purple-team validation of the detections that matter, written document. 6, Post-incident reports with root cause and control changes, written report.\"><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"18\" y=\"18\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"18\" y=\"18\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"36\" y=\"38\">01</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"472\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"end\">In your repo</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"36\" y=\"56\">Detection repository, version-controlled,…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"36\" y1=\"62\" x2=\"472\" y2=\"62\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"23\" y=\"64\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"23\" y=\"64\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"41\" y=\"84\">02</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"477\" y=\"84\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written document</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"41\" y=\"102\">Validated log source inventory with cover…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"41\" y1=\"108\" x2=\"477\" y2=\"108\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"28\" y=\"110\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"28\" y=\"110\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"46\" y=\"130\">03</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"482\" y=\"130\" text-anchor=\"end\">Operating doc</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"46\" y=\"148\">Incident runbook with agreed containment…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"46\" y1=\"154\" x2=\"482\" y2=\"154\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"33\" y=\"156\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"33\" y=\"156\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"51\" y=\"176\">04</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"487\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written report</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"51\" y=\"194\">Monthly coverage and tuning report with r…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"51\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"487\" y2=\"200\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"38\" y=\"202\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"38\" y=\"202\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"56\" y=\"222\">05</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"492\" y=\"222\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written document</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"56\" y=\"240\">Quarterly purple-team validation of the d…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"56\" y1=\"246\" x2=\"492\" y2=\"246\"></line></g><g><rect class=\"dg-sheet\" x=\"43\" y=\"248\" width=\"470\" height=\"92\" rx=\"6\"></rect><rect class=\"dg-sheetSpine\" x=\"43\" y=\"248\" width=\"3\" height=\"92\"></rect><text class=\"dg-sheetNum u-mono\" x=\"61\" y=\"268\">06</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTag\" x=\"497\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"end\">Written report</text><text class=\"dg-sheetTitle\" x=\"61\" y=\"286\">Post-incident reports with root cause and…</text><line class=\"dg-sheetRule\" x1=\"61\" y1=\"292\" x2=\"497\" y2=\"292\"></line></g></svg><figcaption class=\"dg-capNote dg-stackCap\">All 6 artefacts of a Managed Detection &amp; Response engagement, drawn in the order they arrive. Each is listed in full beside this.</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-ticks\" aria-label=\"Deliverables\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Detection repository, version-controlled, mapped to MITRE ATT&amp;CK, yours to keep</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Validated log source inventory with coverage gaps named</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Incident runbook with agreed containment authority and escalation paths</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Monthly coverage and tuning report with reasoning, not just counts</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Quarterly purple-team validation of the detections that matter</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Post-incident reports with root cause and control changes</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"accreditation\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Accreditation</p><h2 id=\"accreditation\" class=\"sv-h2\">Certifications</h2></div><ul class=\"sv-accred\"><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">ISO/IEC 27001:2022 — Information Security Management</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">UKAS-accredited certification body</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">SOC 2 Type II — Security, Availability, Confidentiality</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">Independent CPA firm</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">Cyber Essentials Plus — audited technical controls</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">IASME, on behalf of the NCSC</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">CREST member — penetration testing</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">CREST International</span></span></li><li class=\"sv-accred__item\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check sv-accred__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span><span class=\"sv-accred__label\">PCI QSA — qualified assessor company</span><span class=\"sv-accred__issuer\">PCI Security Standards Council</span></span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/certifications\">Every certificate number and expiry date is published</a> · <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/trust\">Our own security posture</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"outcomes\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Outcomes</p><h2 id=\"outcomes\" class=\"sv-h2\">What changes afterwards</h2></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-ticks\" aria-label=\"Outcomes\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>An analyst makes contact in minutes, with a conclusion rather than an alert</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Detections that reflect your architecture, reviewed like code</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Telemetry gaps found during onboarding rather than during an incident</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Containment inside the window where it still helps</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>Coverage you can show an auditor and a board</span></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check sv-ticks__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span>A detection repository you keep if you leave</span></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"team\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Who does the work</p><h2 id=\"team\" class=\"sv-h2\">The team on your engagement</h2><p class=\"sv-head__lede\">A named service lead, a detection engineer, and a 24/7 analyst rota of nine.</p></div><div class=\"sv-expert\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Placeholder portrait for Daniel Okafor\" class=\"avatar-ph\" style=\"width:96px;height:96px;font-size:33px;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(151 18% 22%), hsl(151 22% 14%))\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">DO</span></div><div><h3 class=\"sv-expert__name\">Daniel Okafor</h3><p class=\"sv-expert__role\">Head of Detection &amp; Response</p><p class=\"sv-expert__bio\">Runs the managed detection service and the cloud security practice. Built and then dismantled three SIEM deployments before concluding that detection content matters more than the platform it runs on.</p><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-expert__certs-label\" id=\"certs-daniel-okafor\">Certifications</p><ul class=\"sv-chips\" aria-labelledby=\"certs-daniel-okafor\"><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">GIAC GCDA</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">GIAC GCIA</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">AWS Security Specialty</span></li><li><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">CISSP</span></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/about/leadership/daniel-okafor\">More about Daniel Okafor</a></p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"case-study\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Proof</p><h2 id=\"case-study\" class=\"sv-h2\">An engagement in full</h2></div><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Freight and customs broker, 1,200 employees</p><p class=\"sv-h3\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s4)\">Onboarding found that 31% of configured log sources had never delivered an event — before a single detection was written.</p><ul class=\"sv-hero__meta\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s6)\"><li>Logistics</li><li>Retainer</li><li>7 weeks to live, retainer ongoing</li><li><span class=\"badge badge--sm badge--neutral\">Under NDA</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:var(--s6)\"><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" href=\"/case-studies/logistics-mdr-rollout\"><span>Read the case study</span><span class=\"btn__icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></p></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><ul class=\"sv-metrics\"><li><strong class=\"sv-metric__value u-tnum\">31%</strong><span class=\"sv-metric__label\">of configured log sources were silently not arriving</span><span class=\"sv-metric__note\">Found in week 3, before go-live</span></li><li><strong class=\"sv-metric__value u-tnum\">4 min</strong><span class=\"sv-metric__label\">median analyst contact on critical detections</span><span class=\"sv-metric__note\">Against a 15-minute contractual commitment</span></li><li><strong class=\"sv-metric__value u-tnum\">11 → 3</strong><span class=\"sv-metric__label\">escalations per week after tuning</span><span class=\"sv-metric__note\">Conclusions, not raw alerts</span></li></ul><figure class=\"sv-quote\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s12)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote sv-quote__mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><blockquote class=\"sv-quote__text\"><p style=\"margin:0\">The thing I had not understood is that we were paying for alert forwarding and calling it detection. Twenty-two log sources had been dead for years and our previous provider’s dashboard showed them green, because it showed configuration, not delivery.</p></blockquote><figcaption class=\"sv-quote__by\">Information Security Manager, Freight and customs broker</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"clients\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"clients\" class=\"u-eyebrow\" style=\"margin-bottom:var(--s6)\">Selected clients</h2><div class=\"marquee\" style=\"--gap:var(--s12);--marquee-dur:52s\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><ul class=\"marquee__track mq-track\" aria-label=\"Selected clients\"><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Northgate Freight</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Logistics</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Lumen Clinical</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Healthcare</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Verity Payments</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Financial Services</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Aldercross Group</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Manufacturing</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Mereway Housing</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Public Sector</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Hallstead Retail</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Retail &amp; Payments</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Carrick Analytics</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">SaaS &amp; Technology</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Pelham Energy</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Energy</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Severn Mutual</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Insurance</span></span></li><li class=\"mq__item\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"mq__text\"><span class=\"mq__label\">Orbis Education</span><span class=\"mq__meta\">Education</span></span></li></ul></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"related\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Related</p><h2 id=\"related\" class=\"sv-h2\">What usually goes with this</h2></div><ul class=\"reveal-group sv-grid sv-grid--2\"><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-siren sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 18v-6a5 5 0 1 1 10 0v6\"></path><path d=\"M5 21a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2z\"></path><path d=\"M21 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M18.5 4.5 18 5\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v1\"></path><path d=\"m4.929 4.929.707.707\"></path><path d=\"M12 12v6\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">24/7 hotline answered by a responder. Retainer or emergency.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cloud sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Identity-path analysis across AWS, Azure and GCP, not a CSPM findings dump.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bug sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v-9\"></path><path d=\"M14 7a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v3a6 6 0 0 1-12 0v-3a4 4 0 0 1 4-4z\"></path><path d=\"M14.12 3.88 16 2\"></path><path d=\"M21 21a4 4 0 0 0-3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M21 5a4 4 0 0 1-3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M22 13h-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 21a4 4 0 0 1 3.81-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 5a4 4 0 0 0 3.55 3.97\"></path><path d=\"M6 13H2\"></path><path d=\"m8 2 1.88 1.88\"></path><path d=\"M9 7.13V6a3 3 0 1 1 6 0v1.13\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Manual, evidence-led testing with criticals reported the hour they are confirmed.</p></div></li><li data-reveal=\"\"><div class=\"card card--pad-lg sv-card\"><div class=\"sv-card__top\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-server sv-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"8\" x=\"2\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><rect width=\"20\" height=\"8\" x=\"2\" y=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"6\" x2=\"6.01\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg><h3 class=\"sv-card__name\"><a class=\"card__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></h3></div><p class=\"sv-card__line\">Reproducible infrastructure, short-lived pipeline identity, and a rehearsed rollback.</p><p style=\"margin:0\"><span class=\"badge badge--md badge--brand\">Software Development</span></p></div></li></ul><p class=\"sv-note\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\"><a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/software-development\">See everything under Software Development</a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"engagement\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Commercials</p><h2 id=\"engagement\" class=\"sv-h2\">Shape, timeline and scoping</h2></div><dl class=\"sv-defs\"><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Timeline</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">7 weeks to full monitoring. Purple-team validation at week 8.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Team shape</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">A named service lead, a detection engineer, and a 24/7 analyst rota of nine.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Engagement</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">Annual retainer priced by log volume and endpoint count, with incident response hours included.</dd></div><div class=\"sv-def\"><dt class=\"sv-def__term\">Scoping</dt><dd class=\"sv-def__desc\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.<!-- --> <a class=\"u-link\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\">How the four engagement models differ</a>.</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"topics\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Explainers</p><h2 id=\"topics\" class=\"sv-h2\">Questions about MDR</h2></div><ul class=\"sv-links\" aria-label=\"Questions buyers ask about this service\"><li><a class=\"sv-links__a\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response/mdr-service-levels\"><span class=\"sv-links__label\">What an MDR service level should commit to<span class=\"sv-links__blurb\">Every provider quotes 15 minutes. Fifteen minutes to what?</span></span><svg class=\"sv-links__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"sv-links__a\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response/build-or-buy-a-soc\"><span class=\"sv-links__label\">Build or buy a SOC<span class=\"sv-links__blurb\">At what size does running our own start to make sense?</span></span><svg class=\"sv-links__arrow\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" aria-labelledby=\"faq\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-head\"><div class=\"sv-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\">Questions</p><h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"sv-h2\">Frequently asked</h2></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do we have to move to your platform?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. We would rather operate what you already have, and your data staying in your tenancy and your region is usually the right answer for both data residency and exit. If you have no platform we will deploy one in your account — not ours.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does your SLA actually commit to?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Time to human contact, not time to alert forwarding. Fifteen minutes for critical, with a 2026 median of six. A service level measured on forwarding speed rewards the wrong behaviour and you should read every MDR contract for which one it buys.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can you contain without asking us?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Only what you pre-authorise in the runbook, and we notify immediately. Most clients authorise host isolation and session revocation after a confirmed detection, and require a call before anything that affects production availability. The authority is reviewed quarterly.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do you avoid drowning us in alerts?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Analysts investigate before escalating, so volume to you is conclusions rather than alerts — typically single digits per week for a mid-size estate. False-positive rate and tuning decisions are reported monthly with the reasoning, so you can challenge them.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What if we are breached right now?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Call the hotline. Do not wait for an onboarding call — incident response is available to non-clients and the number is in the navigation of every page on this site.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you cover cloud and identity, or only endpoints?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Cloud control plane, identity provider, SaaS audit logs, network and endpoint. Identity is where most real intrusions are now visible first, and an EDR-only service will miss a session-token replay entirely.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What happens to the detections if we leave?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"They are yours. The repository is in your source control from day one, written in Sigma or your platform’s native language, with the test cases. Exit should cost you nothing but notice.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"\"><div class=\"faq faq__accordion\" data-orientation=\"vertical\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_iulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_2ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Do we have to move to your platform?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_iulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_2ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_kulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_4ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>What does your SLA actually commit to?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_kulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_4ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_mulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_6ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Can you contain without asking us?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_mulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_6ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_oulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_8ulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>How do you avoid drowning us in alerts?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_oulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_8ulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_qulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_aulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>What if we are breached right now?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_qulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_aulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_sulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_culinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>Do you cover cloud and identity, or only endpoints?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_sulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_culinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"faq__item\"><h3 class=\"faq__header\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\"><button type=\"button\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_uulinpfiutb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_eulinpfiutb_\" class=\"faq__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\"><span>What happens to the detections if we leave?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down faq__chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_uulinpfiutb_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_eulinpfiutb_\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"acc-content faq__content\" style=\"--radix-accordion-content-height:var(--radix-collapsible-content-height);--radix-accordion-content-width:var(--radix-collapsible-content-width)\"></div></div></div><dl class=\"faq__nojs\"><div><dt>Do we have to move to your platform?</dt><dd>No. We would rather operate what you already have, and your data staying in your tenancy and your region is usually the right answer for both data residency and exit. If you have no platform we will deploy one in your account — not ours.</dd></div><div><dt>What does your SLA actually commit to?</dt><dd>Time to human contact, not time to alert forwarding. Fifteen minutes for critical, with a 2026 median of six. A service level measured on forwarding speed rewards the wrong behaviour and you should read every MDR contract for which one it buys.</dd></div><div><dt>Can you contain without asking us?</dt><dd>Only what you pre-authorise in the runbook, and we notify immediately. Most clients authorise host isolation and session revocation after a confirmed detection, and require a call before anything that affects production availability. The authority is reviewed quarterly.</dd></div><div><dt>How do you avoid drowning us in alerts?</dt><dd>Analysts investigate before escalating, so volume to you is conclusions rather than alerts — typically single digits per week for a mid-size estate. False-positive rate and tuning decisions are reported monthly with the reasoning, so you can challenge them.</dd></div><div><dt>What if we are breached right now?</dt><dd>Call the hotline. Do not wait for an onboarding call — incident response is available to non-clients and the number is in the navigation of every page on this site.</dd></div><div><dt>Do you cover cloud and identity, or only endpoints?</dt><dd>Cloud control plane, identity provider, SaaS audit logs, network and endpoint. Identity is where most real intrusions are now visible first, and an EDR-only service will miss a session-token replay entirely.</dd></div><div><dt>What happens to the detections if we leave?</dt><dd>They are yours. The repository is in your source control from day one, written in Sigma or your platform’s native language, with the test cases. Exit should cost you nothing but notice.</dd></div></dl></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" aria-labelledby=\"enquiry-h2\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-rail\"><div class=\"sv-rail__aside\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Get started</p><h2 id=\"enquiry-h2\" class=\"sv-h2\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s3)\">Book a 60-minute scoping call</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">A technical conversation with the person who would lead the work — not a qualification script, not a discovery deck. You come away with a written scope, the exclusions stated in the body rather than in an appendix, and a day count that we have not padded.</p><p class=\"sv-note\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-3px;margin-right:var(--s2)\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>A named service lead, a detection engineer, and a 24/7 analyst rota of nine.</p></div><div class=\"sv-rail__body\"><form class=\"sv-form\" id=\"enquiry-form\" action=\"\" encType=\"multipart/form-data\" method=\"POST\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"$ACTION_ID_403c44504416ed33d4af4350092b655f174641e336\"/><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"returnTo\" value=\"/services/managed-detection-response\"/><div id=\"enquiry-incomplete\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>Some required fields came through empty. They are marked below — fill them in and send again.</p></div><div id=\"enquiry-email\" class=\"sv-form__error\" role=\"alert\"><p>That email address did not look complete. Check it and send again.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-name\">Your name<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-name\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"name\" name=\"name\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-email\">Business email<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-email\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"email\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"email\" aria-describedby=\"enq-email-help\" name=\"email\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-email-help\">We reply from a person, not a no-reply address.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-company\">Company<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-company\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"organization\" name=\"company\"/></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-country\">Country<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><input id=\"enq-country\" class=\"sv-input\" type=\"text\" required=\"\" autoComplete=\"country-name\" aria-describedby=\"enq-country-help\" name=\"country\"/><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-country-help\">Relevant for data residency and time zone.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-interest\">What is this about<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><select id=\"enq-interest\" name=\"interest\" class=\"sv-select\" required=\"\"><option value=\"\" disabled=\"\">Choose one</option><option value=\"penetration-testing\">Penetration testing</option><option value=\"application-security\">Application security programme</option><option value=\"cloud-security\">Cloud security review</option><option value=\"grc-compliance\">SOC 2 / ISO 27001 / PCI DSS</option><option value=\"managed-detection-response\" selected=\"\">Managed detection &amp; response</option><option value=\"red-teaming\">Red team</option><option value=\"vciso\">vCISO</option><option value=\"custom-software\">Custom software build</option><option value=\"web-application-development\">Web application</option><option value=\"platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</option><option value=\"business-systems\">ERP / CRM / HRM / LMS</option><option value=\"devsecops\">Secure SDLC — build and test together</option><option value=\"not-sure\">Not sure yet — help me work it out</option></select></div><div class=\"sv-field\"><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-message\">What are you trying to achieve, and what is the deadline<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><textarea id=\"enq-message\" name=\"message\" class=\"sv-textarea\" rows=\"5\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-message-help\"></textarea><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-message-help\">Two or three sentences is plenty. The constraint is usually more useful than the requirement.</p></div><div class=\"sv-field sv-field--check\"><input id=\"enq-consent\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"sv-check\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"enq-consent-help\" name=\"consent\"/><span><label class=\"sv-label\" for=\"enq-consent\">I agree to Envenox contacting me about this enquiry.<span class=\"sv-req\" aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label><p class=\"sv-help\" id=\"enq-consent-help\">We keep enquiry details for 24 months from last contact and never share them. See the privacy notice.</p></span></div><p class=\"sv-help\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"sv-req\">*</span> <!-- -->Required.</p><div class=\"sv-form__actions\"><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\"><span>Send an enquiry</span></button><p class=\"sv-form__sla\">A named engineer replies within one business day. Scoping call within three.</p></div></form></div></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section-tight\" data-theme-section=\"deep\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"sv-cta-band\"><div><h2 class=\"sv-h2\">Analysts who read your architecture before they read your alerts.</h2><p class=\"sv-lede\">Annual retainer priced by log volume and endpoint count, with incident response hours included.</p></div><div class=\"sv-cta-band__actions\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--lg\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--lg\" href=\"/case-studies\"><span>See the work</span></a></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Incident response — 24/7</span></span><span class=\"foot__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span><span class=\"foot__hotline-note\">Answered by a responder, 24/7. Median pickup under 4 minutes.</span></a></div><nav class=\"foot__cols\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Cybersecurity</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Software Development</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Applications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/erp\">ERP</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/crm\">CRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/hrm\">HRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/lms\">LMS</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/qa-automation\">QA &amp; Test Automation</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Company</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/locations\">Locations</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/partners\">Partners</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Proof &amp; Resources</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Sample Report</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li></ul></div></nav></div><div class=\"foot__mid\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Offices</h2><div class=\"foot__offices\"><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>London<!-- -->, <!-- -->United Kingdom</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Dhaka<!-- -->, <!-- -->Bangladesh</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">Level 7, Bay’s Galleria, Gulshan 1, Dhaka 1212</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>General enquiries</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:hello@envenox.com\">hello@envenox.com</a></p></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Security reports</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:security@envenox.com\">security@envenox.com</a></p></div></div></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Research notes</h2><form class=\"foot__form\" action=\"/api/newsletter\" method=\"post\"><label class=\"foot__form-label\" for=\"footer-newsletter-email\">Email address</label><div class=\"foot__form-row\"><input class=\"foot__input\" id=\"footer-newsletter-email\" type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footer-newsletter-hint\" name=\"email\"/><button class=\"foot__submit\" type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button></div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\" value=\"footer\"/><p class=\"foot__form-hint\" id=\"footer-newsletter-hint\">Advisories, teardowns and methodology notes. Roughly monthly. No sales sequence, one-click unsubscribe.</p></form></div></div><div class=\"foot__bottom\"><div class=\"foot__legal\"><p class=\"foot__legal-line\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Envenox Ltd<!-- -->. Registered in England and Wales. Registered office:<!-- --> <!-- -->1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT<!-- -->.</p><ul class=\"foot__legal-nav\"><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/privacy\">Privacy</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/cookies\">Cookies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/terms\">Terms</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/accessibility\">Accessibility</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/vulnerability-disclosure\">Vulnerability disclosure</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/sitemap\">Sitemap</a></li></ul></div><ul class=\"foot__social\"><li><a class=\"foot__social-link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/envenox\" rel=\"me noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>LinkedIn</span><span class=\"foot__vh\"> (opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"foot__social-link\" href=\"https://github.com/envenox\" r