\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\\\",\\\"data-theme-section\\\":\\\"deep\\\",\\\"style\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"aria-labelledby\\\":\\\"faq\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-container\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-head\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-head__rule\\\",\\\"aria-hidden\\\":\\\"true\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-eyebrow sv-head__eyebrow\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Questions\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"id\\\":\\\"faq\\\",\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-h2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Frequently asked\\\"}],null]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L7d\\\",null,{\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Do we have to move to your platform?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"No. We would rather operate what you already have, and your data staying in your tenancy and your region is usually the right answer for both data residency and exit. If you have no platform we will deploy one in your account — not ours.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What does your SLA actually commit to?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Time to human contact, not time to alert forwarding. Fifteen minutes for critical, with a 2026 median of six. A service level measured on forwarding speed rewards the wrong behaviour and you should read every MDR contract for which one it buys.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Can you contain without asking us?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Only what you pre-authorise in the runbook, and we notify immediately. Most clients authorise host isolation and session revocation after a confirmed detection, and require a call before anything that affects production availability. The authority is reviewed quarterly.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"How do you avoid drowning us in alerts?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Analysts investigate before escalating, so volume to you is conclusions rather than alerts — typically single digits per week for a mid-size estate. False-positive rate and tuning decisions are reported monthly with the reasoning, so you can challenge them.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What if we are breached right now?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Call the hotline. Do not wait for an onboarding call — incident response is available to non-clients and the number is in the navigation of every page on this site.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"Do you cover cloud and identity, or only endpoints?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"Cloud control plane, identity provider, SaaS audit logs, network and endpoint. Identity is where most real intrusions are now visible first, and an EDR-only service will miss a session-token replay entirely.\\\"},{\\\"q\\\":\\\"What happens to the detections if we leave?\\\",\\\"a\\\":\\\"They are yours. The repository is in your source control from day one, written in Sigma or your platform’s native language, with the test cases. Exit should cost you nothing but notice.\\\"}],\\\"headingLevel\\\":3}]]}]}]]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"7e:{\\\"id\\\":\\\"403c44504416ed33d4af4350092b655f174641e336\\\",\\\"bound\\\":null}\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"39:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"style\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"envenox-section\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"default\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"\\\\n.sec {\\\\n  position: relative;\\\\n  background-color: var(--bg);\\\\n  color: var(--fg);\\\\n}\\\\n/* Grain sits at z-index 1 with pointer-events none; content rides above it. */\\\\n.sec \\u003e .u-container,\\\\n.sec \\u003e .sec__bleed { position: relative; z-index: 2; }\\\\n\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\\\",\\\"data-theme-section\\\":\\\"dark\\\",\\\"style\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"aria-labelledby\\\":\\\"enquiry-h2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"u-container\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"sv-rail\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\